WEBVTT

00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:07.032
We will start with ordinary common table expressions because they make complex queries easier to read.

00:00:07.032 --> 00:00:12.327
Then we will introduce recursive common table expressions for hierarchies.

00:00:12.327 --> 00:00:17.067
After that, we will study the over clause and window functions.

00:00:17.067 --> 00:00:20.202
Ranking and sequence functions come next.

00:00:20.202 --> 00:00:23.072
Then we will make frames explicit.

00:00:23.072 --> 00:00:29.663
Finally, we will combine common table expressions and windows into useful analytical patterns.
